We believe that today’s talents are tomorrow’s global leaders, and we look forward to helping shape your future! We have an excellent opportunity for you!
 We are looking for an Intern to join our Legal Team .
 Based in Sorocaba and reporting to the LATAM Labor Legal Manager , you will be involved in the daily routine of the legal department, focusing on the following activities:
 You will be responsible for: 
 Monitoring legal publications through the case management system (Pro Juris);
 Maintaining internal litigation controls;
 Supporting the Labor Lawyer with the management of external law firms handling labor lawsuits;
 Managing the schedule of hearings and expert examinations;
 Requesting documentation required for the preparation of labor defenses and performing critical analysis of received documents;
 Drafting legal documents in general, such as Extrajudicial Notices and responses to Official Letters;
 Participating in meetings with other company areas and external law firms (case discussions, alignment prior to expert examinations and hearings, etc.);
 Supporting the Labor Lawyer in the preparation of legal opinions;
 Registering, controlling, and monitoring deadlines for payment of court fees (costs/fees/outstanding balances, etc.) and appeal deposits;
 Performing other activities compatible with the objectives of the internship.
